  Library
LOCATION:Niceville Library\, 206 N Partin Dr\, Niceville\, FL 32578
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 10/29 · 5:00 PM to 6:00 PM\n\nThe Niceville Library s
 creens the nature documentary Dracula's Hidden Kingdom\, a 55 minute look 
 at the wildlife and wild places of Transylvania. The film covers the Carpa
 thian Mountains\, ancient forests\, wolves\, bears\, bats\, storks and lyn
 x. Seating is first come\, first served and the screening is for ages 18 a
 nd up.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.c
 om/events/ev-niceville-library-dracula-hidden-kingdom-documentary-1029.htm
